  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:00.871" end="00:07.326" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(The world is yours)</p>
      <p begin="00:07.326" end="00:08.826" ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus: 1nonly]</p>
      <p begin="00:08.664" end="00:16.429" ttm:agent="v1">Like, shit, ****, damn, hold up, wait just a minute</p>
      <p begin="00:16.429" end="00:18.299" ttm:agent="v1">Too much money, pockets can't fit it</p>
      <p begin="00:18.299" end="00:20.180" ttm:agent="v1">Four, five shots, this MAC got no limit</p>
      <p begin="00:20.180" end="00:22.045" ttm:agent="v1">Bitch call me, said she want to visit</p>
      <p begin="00:22.045" end="00:23.649" ttm:agent="v1">Come through, bitch, **** you</p>
      <p begin="00:23.649" end="00:25.252" ttm:agent="v1">Ten racks my kicks, like Kung-Fu</p>
      <p begin="00:25.252" end="00:27.124" ttm:agent="v1">Want beef, then I hit 'em with the one, two</p>
      <p begin="00:27.124" end="00:29.538" ttm:agent="v1">One, two shots to your dome, now you're done soon</p>
      <p begin="00:29.538" end="00:31.665" ttm:agent="v1">Like, shit, ****, damn, hold up, wait just a minute</p>
      <p begin="00:31.665" end="00:33.165" ttm:agent="v1">Too much money, pockets can't fit it</p>
      <p begin="00:32.990" end="00:34.874" ttm:agent="v1">Four, five shots, this MAC got no limit</p>
      <p begin="00:34.874" end="00:36.761" ttm:agent="v1">Bitch call me, said she want to visit</p>
      <p begin="00:36.761" end="00:38.672" ttm:agent="v1">Come through, bitch, **** you</p>
      <p begin="00:38.672" end="00:40.172" ttm:agent="v1">Ten racks my kicks, like Kung-Fu</p>
      <p begin="00:40.010" end="00:41.880" ttm:agent="v1">Want beef, then I hit 'em with the one, two</p>
      <p begin="00:41.880" end="00:44.567" ttm:agent="v1">One, two shots to your dome, now you're done soon, done soon, bitch</p>
      <p begin="00:44.567" end="00:46.067" ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 1: Shady Moon &amp; Ciscaux]</p>
      <p begin="00:44.818" end="00:46.318" ttm:agent="v1">We don't-we don't make music, we talk shit</p>
      <p begin="00:46.188" end="00:47.778" ttm:agent="v1">Bad bitch from thе party finna pop shit</p>
      <p begin="00:47.778" end="00:49.642" ttm:agent="v1">Emo bitch 'cause I been wanna rock shit</p>
      <p begin="00:49.642" end="00:51.539" ttm:agent="v1">Tell me, what thе **** is this nonsense?</p>
      <p begin="00:51.539" end="00:53.407" ttm:agent="v1">Damn, got ten on the 'gram, huh</p>
      <p begin="00:53.407" end="00:55.002" ttm:agent="v1">But he don't got ten in his hand</p>
      <p begin="00:55.002" end="00:57.461" ttm:agent="v1">Talk down, but you been a fan (**** you, Shady)</p>
      <p begin="00:57.461" end="00:59.389" ttm:agent="v1">Bitch, I been somewhere you don't wanna ever stand</p>
      <p begin="00:59.389" end="01:00.889" ttm:agent="v1">I got plugs in state, I might fly to Atlanta</p>
      <p begin="01:00.468" end="01:02.349" ttm:agent="v1">Three hoes at the crib, bitch, I feel like Santa</p>
      <p begin="01:02.349" end="01:04.241" ttm:agent="v1">Bruce Lee, kick, flippin' out, goin' bananas</p>
      <p begin="01:04.241" end="01:06.171" ttm:agent="v1">Kick a bitch out quit, I don't got no manners</p>
      <p begin="01:06.171" end="01:08.050" ttm:agent="v1">She's so damn bad, but she not for me</p>
      <p begin="01:08.050" end="01:09.650" ttm:agent="v1">Chained down, neck tat', red eyes on green</p>
      <p begin="01:09.650" end="01:11.521" ttm:agent="v1">Girl's toxic as ****, wonder where she sees</p>
      <p begin="01:11.521" end="01:13.425" ttm:agent="v1">Real rude bitch, she for real just like me (Yeah, ayy)</p>
      <p begin="01:13.425" end="01:15.565" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, she just like me, go bestie, go</p>
      <p begin="01:15.565" end="01:17.172" ttm:agent="v1">I can't deal with no friendly hoe</p>
      <p begin="01:17.172" end="01:19.031" ttm:agent="v1">So bad, might take her to Mexico</p>
      <p begin="01:19.031" end="01:20.935" ttm:agent="v1">If you're ready to leave, then just let me know</p>
      <p begin="01:20.935" end="01:22.805" ttm:agent="v1">This fit right here, it cost me a rent day</p>
      <p begin="01:22.805" end="01:24.663" ttm:agent="v1">Busy getting money, I don't care what the rest say</p>
      <p begin="01:24.663" end="01:26.521" ttm:agent="v1">Talk to me short, I'ma leave yo' ass stretched, ayy</p>
      <p begin="01:26.521" end="01:28.655" ttm:agent="v1">Leave her walkin' out like she just hit leg day</p>
      <p begin="01:28.655" end="01:30.281" ttm:agent="v1">Zoey 101, are you ready?</p>
      <p begin="01:30.281" end="01:32.138" ttm:agent="v1">Pistol by my side, it get heavy</p>
      <p begin="01:32.138" end="01:34.042" ttm:agent="v1">Whip the new Porsche like an old-school Chevy</p>
      <p begin="01:34.042" end="01:35.691" ttm:agent="v1">They steal all my flows and they actin' so friendly</p>
      <p begin="01:35.691" end="01:37.316" ttm:agent="v1">I swear y'all a joke, but that shit isn't funny</p>
      <p begin="01:37.316" end="01:39.221" ttm:agent="v1">You copy my looks, but you still lookin' bummy</p>
      <p begin="01:39.221" end="01:41.090" ttm:agent="v1">The flow like the drip of the nose 'cause it's runny</p>
      <p begin="01:41.090" end="01:43.255" ttm:agent="v1">My bitch know my songs, so she bounce like a bunny</p>
      <p begin="01:43.255" end="01:44.755" ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus: 1nonly]</p>
      <p begin="01:43.516" end="01:45.167" ttm:agent="v1">Like, shit, ****, damn, hold up, wait just a minute</p>
      <p begin="01:45.167" end="01:47.058" ttm:agent="v1">Too much money, pockets can't fit it</p>
      <p begin="01:47.058" end="01:48.661" ttm:agent="v1">Four, five shots, this MAC got no limit</p>
      <p begin="01:48.661" end="01:50.537" ttm:agent="v1">Bitch call me, said she want to visit</p>
      <p begin="01:50.537" end="01:52.144" ttm:agent="v1">Come through, bitch, **** you</p>
      <p begin="01:52.144" end="01:53.746" ttm:agent="v1">Ten racks my kicks, like Kung-Fu</p>
      <p begin="01:53.746" end="01:55.677" ttm:agent="v1">Want beef, then I hit 'em with the one, two</p>
      <p begin="01:55.677" end="01:58.061" ttm:agent="v1">One, two shots to your dome, now you're done soon</p>
      <p begin="01:58.061" end="01:59.978" ttm:agent="v1">Like, shit, ****, damn, hold up, wait just a minute</p>
      <p begin="01:59.978" end="02:01.590" ttm:agent="v1">Too much money, pockets can't fit it</p>
      <p begin="02:01.590" end="02:03.464" ttm:agent="v1">Four, five shots, this MAC got no limit</p>
      <p begin="02:03.464" end="02:05.087" ttm:agent="v1">Bitch call me, said she want to visit</p>
      <p begin="02:05.087" end="02:06.957" ttm:agent="v1">Come through, bitch, **** you</p>
      <p begin="02:06.957" end="02:08.571" ttm:agent="v1">Ten racks my kicks, like Kung-Fu</p>
      <p begin="02:08.571" end="02:10.727" ttm:agent="v1">Want beef, then I hit 'em with the one, two</p>
      <p begin="02:10.727" end="02:13.126" ttm:agent="v1">One, two shots to your dome, now you're done soon, done soon, bitch</p>
      <p begin="02:13.126" end="02:14.626" ttm:agent="v1">Come through, bitch, **** you</p>
      <p begin="02:14.470" end="02:16.071" ttm:agent="v1">C-Come through, bitch, **** you</p>
      <p begin="02:16.071" end="02:17.977" ttm:agent="v1">C-Come through, bitch, **** you</p>
      <p begin="02:17.977" end="02:19.581" ttm:agent="v1">C-Come through, bitch, **** you, **** you</p>
      <p begin="02:19.581" end="02:21.710" ttm:agent="v1">Come through, bitch, **** you</p>
      <p begin="02:21.710" end="02:23.340" ttm:agent="v1">C-Come through, bitch, **** you</p>
      <p begin="02:23.340" end="02:25.231" ttm:agent="v1">C-Come through, bitch, **** you</p>
      <p begin="02:25.231" end="02:29.231" ttm:agent="v1">**** you, **** you, **** you, f-f-f—</p>
